=head1 NAME

{% name %}::Controller::API::{% auth_class %} - generated security checkers

=head1 DESCRIPTION

One checker per C<securityScheme> that F<openapi.json> requires, generated
by C<punk new --api> and wired into the mount in L<{% name %}>.

Each is called as C<< ($credential, $c, $operation_id, $scopes) >> and
returns a true value to authorise - which becomes
C<< $c->stash->{auth} >> - or false to answer C<401>.

B<Every one of these refuses until you implement it>, so the operations
the specification protects stay protected rather than being opened by a
placeholder.

